---
import founderAvatar from "@/images/assets/michael-andreuzza.jpg";
---

<section
  aria-label="A note from the founder"
  class="bg-muted relative flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 overflow-hidden rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6"
>
  <p class="text-foreground text-xs font-medium">From the founder</p>
  <div class="mt-24 space-y-6 lg:mt-32">
    <p
      class="text-foreground text-lg lg:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty lg:text-balance"
    >
      I make my living, designing, building and selling websites, and I was
      never happy with the analytics behind them &mdash; they either tracked
      too much or told me too little. Kobbe is the tool I wanted for my own
      sites: open the dashboard, read it, make a decision, get back to work.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
      I use it every day and build it in the open. If something is missing,
      tell me &mdash; there is a good chance I will ship it.
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img
        src={founderAvatar.src}
        alt="Michael Andreuzza"
        class="size-10 rounded-md object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
        width="40"
        height="40"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="text-foreground text-sm font-medium">Michael Andreuzza</p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
          Founder &middot;{" "}
          <a
            href="https://x.com/Mike_Andreuzza"
            rel="noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
            class="hover:text-foreground transition-colors duration-200"
            >@Mike_Andreuzza</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
